# Security changes and live users

Cenhub CRM has **live clients**. Security work must not break leads, customers, webhooks, login, or admin dashboards.

## Two-agent workflow

1. **Implement** using project skill `security-hardening-live-safe` (small diff, fail-open on logging DB errors, kill-switches documented).
2. **Verify** using project skill `post-security-regression` before declaring deploy-safe.

Run `npm test` and relevant verify scripts in the regression pass.

## Bulk list rate limits

`GET /api/leads` and `GET /api/customers` are rate-limited. If changing limits or enforcement:

- Keep normal live sync under the cap (debounced refetch ~120/min worst case).
- Respect `BULK_LIST_RATE_LIMIT_DISABLED=1` emergency bypass.
- See [docs/LIVE-SAFE-SECURITY-DEPLOYS.md](../docs/LIVE-SAFE-SECURITY-DEPLOYS.md).

## Migrations

Prefer additive migrations. After RLS changes, run `npm run db:verify-tenant-isolation` when env is available.